    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/cd/Pollux_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250118011618\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Pollux Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/cd/Pollux_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250118011618\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"997\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Pollux Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Pollux_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>巨拳</b>\n\n一位美丽的战士，以她的巨大手甲而引人注目。尽管她身材娇小，她的重击足以摧毁大地。据说竞技场会挤满争相观看她比赛的人们。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/16/Pollux_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250118012424\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Pollux S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/16/Pollux_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250118012424\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"798\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Pollux S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Pollux_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/2e/FB_IMG_1740272224872.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250223230358\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"FB IMG 1740272224872\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/2e/FB_IMG_1740272224872.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250223230358\" decodi